.vercel/

# Android local config
android/local.properties
android/keystore.properties
# google-services.json MUST be uploaded: android/ is committed, so EAS
# never runs prebuild and scripts/prebuild-firebase.js cannot create it.
# The file is public client config (no secrets) and stays out of git.
# android/app/google-services.json
android/app/release/
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/.gradle/

